    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Goblin Dungeons</strong> is a roguelike RPG with adult elements. Fight dangerous foes, master powerful magic, and experience sensual encounters in a dark fantasy world on the brink of collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197740/extras/9b9b8ab8ddb10199775a158e8d9e3949.poster.avif?t=1749561220\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197740/extras/9b9b8ab8ddb10199775a158e8d9e3949.webm?t=1749561220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197740/extras/9b9b8ab8ddb10199775a158e8d9e3949.mp4?t=1749561220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world of Erotis has fallen to the goblins. Most life is wiped out, and the survivors are enslaved. Only the ancient elven priestesses still had hope \u2014 performing a secret ritual to summon help from another world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197740/extras/59434c3ec8f6fce5562521a7c1dddc55.poster.avif?t=1749561220\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197740/extras/59434c3ec8f6fce5562521a7c1dddc55.webm?t=1749561220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197740/extras/59434c3ec8f6fce5562521a7c1dddc55.mp4?t=1749561220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are Ellie, a girl who died in our world and was revived by a forgotten god. To return home, you must destroy the Goblin Lord. Gifted with magic and immortality, you rise again after every death \u2014 stronger than before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197740/extras/c0972151699b36146ed09df829c0737f.poster.avif?t=1749561220\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197740/extras/c0972151699b36146ed09df829c0737f.webm?t=1749561220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197740/extras/c0972151699b36146ed09df829c0737f.mp4?t=1749561220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f Fast-paced combat with unique enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2640\ufe0f Deep magic system with 4 schools to combine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udff0 Upgrade your base, unlock skills and gear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb2 Random events and seductive encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd1e Erotic content with interactive scenes, X-Ray mode, and more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you fulfill the contract and save Erotis \u2014 or will you remain trapped in an endless cycle of death and rebirth?</p>",
